                                                <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#de350b&quot;&gt;Requirement to be revisited based upon the Audit trail stories in R3.0.0 - excel/pdf reports that currently exist - webpage that can be filtered?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1) Audit Trail filter&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Given&lt;/b&gt;&#160;a Signals Experiment with a GxP General or GxP External Partner template&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;When&lt;/b&gt;&#160;the User requests the experiment audit trail via the external action&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Then&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;the system generates the GxP Experiment Audit Trail with a filter option in the header&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The filter will be set default on Changes: Modified, Changes: Trashed (deleted)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;the system generates the GxP Experiment Audit Trail with the results of the default applied filters&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;the user shall be able to apply additional filters with the following characteristics:&#160;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;It must be possible to filter on:
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Date
			&lt;ul&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;eg. Date: 06-DEC-2025&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;/ul&gt;
			&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Details&#160;
			&lt;ul&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;eg. Details: Background worksheet, Details: Preparation Master grid, Details, ...&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;/ul&gt;
			&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Action (see &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-25&quot; title=&quot;Reports_Audit Trail: Experiment Audit Trail- Ad hoc report generation&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;JGVT-25&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;JGVT-25&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)
			&lt;ul&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;eg. Action: Edited Table, Action: Edited Worksheet, Action: Created Worksheet,&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;/ul&gt;
			&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;User
			&lt;ul&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;eg. User ID: tvande17&lt;/li&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;eg. User Name: Tamara Van den Broeck&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;/ul&gt;
			&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;Changes
			&lt;ul&gt;
				&lt;li&gt;eg. Changes: Worksheet changes, Changes: Row Added, Changes: Row Modified, ...&lt;/li&gt;
			&lt;/ul&gt;
			&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;It must be possible to select multiple filter parameters&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;It must be possible to deselect the applied filter parameters including the default filters&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;The filter must refine by start typing&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;the system generates the GxP Experiment Audit Trail with the results of the additional applied or removed filters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</customfieldvalue>

